[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13211.269, "timestamp": "03:40:11", "text": "去电视机前，然后去你的行李箱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13218.95, "timestamp": "03:40:18", "text": "我必须从“好的”开始。我是否"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13220.99, "timestamp": "03:40:20", "text": "不小心买了别的东西？好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13225.51, "timestamp": "03:40:25", "text": "等待。呃，我要补充一点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13229.269, "timestamp": "03:40:29", "text": "好的。等等，我们之前有……不，确实有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13234.71, "timestamp": "03:40:34", "text": "等等，你没有，你没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13237.349, "timestamp": "03:40:37", "text": "你有体温计吗？你必须买它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13239.51, "timestamp": "03:40:39", "text": "你买了吗？知道了。知道了。知道了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13241.59, "timestamp": "03:40:41", "text": "知道了。呃，向下滚动。等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13248.389, "timestamp": "03:40:48", "text": "哦，是两个。等等，我买过两个吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13251.269, "timestamp": "03:40:51", "text": "他们？我的天啊。移除一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13254.71, "timestamp": "03:40:54", "text": "买两个没问题。只需用一个就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13257.269, "timestamp": "03:40:57", "text": "不，不。即使如此，他们所有人都会去"}]